  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2598e857b284925a344cfeb3fb12f50, type: 3}
  m_Name: Linh_ArchaeologistSOS
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: LINH
  portrait: {fileID: -1297769870653861099, guid: b2dcf0c911c6cdd4ea996aa2005d4ebb, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: C to continue
  closePrompt: C to finish
  lines:
  - english: You defeated the monsters near the tower. Now we know that only the
      equipment from the tower can defeat them.
    vietnamese: "Anh \u0111\xE3 h\u1EA1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EEFng con qu\xE1i
      v\u1EADt g\u1EA7n th\xE1p. Gi\u1EDD ch\xFAng ta \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt ch\u1EC9
      c\xF3 trang b\u1ECB l\u1EA5y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trong th\xE1p m\u1EDBi ti\xEAu
      di\u1EC7t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\xFAng."
  - english: We just received a call for help from an archaeologist. Check your map
      to see where he is
    vietnamese: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EEBa nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EDDi
      c\u1EA7u c\u1EE9u t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t nh\xE0 kh\u1EA3o c\u1ED5. H\xE3y xem b\u1EA3n
      \u0111\u1ED3 \u0111\u1EC3 x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a \xF4ng
      \u1EA5y."
  - english: He may know why these monsters appeared and how to defeat them
    vietnamese: "\xD4ng \u1EA5y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt v\xEC sao nh\u1EEFng con
      qu\xE1i v\u1EADt n\xE0y xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n v\xE0 c\xE1ch ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t
      ch\xFAng."
  - english: Monsters are blocking the road to him. Defeat them and rescue him. Then
      talk to him to learn more.
    vietnamese: "Qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u0111ang ch\u1EB7n con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EABn
      \u0111\u1EBFn ch\u1ED7 \xF4ng \u1EA5y. H\xE3y ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t ch\xFAng v\xE0
      gi\u1EA3i c\u1EE9u \xF4ng \u1EA5y. Sau \u0111\xF3, h\xE3y n\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n
      v\u1EDBi \xF4ng \u1EA5y \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm hi\u1EC3u th\xEAm."
